<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>EmployeeHub - <%= title %></title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/7.3.1/css/all.min.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/navbar.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/about.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/footer.css">
</head>
<body>
    <%- include("partials/navbar") %>
    <main class="about-page">
        <section class="about-hero">
            <div class="about-hero-content">
                <div class="about-badge">
                    <span class="badge-dot"></span>ABOUT EMPLOYEEHUB
                </div>
                <h1>Simplifying the way <span>you manage your team.</span>
                </h1>
                <p>EmployeeHub is a modern employee management platform designed to help organizations organize employee information, monitor workforce activity and manage essential employee data from one place.</p>
                <div class="hero-actions">
                    <a href="/employees" class="primary-btn">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-users"></i> Explore Employees
                    </a>
                    <a href="/dashboard" class="secondary-btn">
                        View Dashboard<i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i>
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="about-hero-visual">
                <div class="visual-card">
                    <div class="visual-card-header">
                        <div>
                            <span>WORKFORCE OVERVIEW</span><h3>EmployeeHub</h3>
                        </div>
                        <div class="visual-status">
                            <span></span>Live
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="visual-stats">
                        <div class="visual-stat">
                            <div class="visual-stat-icon purple">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-users"></i>
                            </div>
                            <div>
                                <strong id="heroTotalEmployees">10</strong>
                                <span>Employees</span>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="visual-stat">
                            <div class="visual-stat-icon green">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-user-check"></i>
                            </div>
                            <div>
                                <strong id="heroActiveEmployees">8</strong>
                                <span>Active</span>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="visual-stat">
                            <div class="visual-stat-icon blue">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-building"></i>
                            </div>
                            <div>
                                <strong id="heroDepartments">5</strong>
                                <span>Departments</span>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="visual-stat">
                            <div class="visual-stat-icon orange">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-indian-rupee-sign"></i>
                            </div>
                            <div>
                                <strong id="heroPayroll">₹7,38,800</strong>
                                <span>Monthly Payroll</span>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="visual-progress">
                        <div class="progress-header">
                            <span>Workforce Status</span>
                            <strong id="heroPercentage">80%</strong>
                        </div>
                        <div class="progress-track">
                            <div class="progress-fill" id="heroProgress"></div>
                        </div>
                        <span class="progress-text">Active employees currently working</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="floating-card floating-card-one">
                    <div class="floating-icon purple">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-user-plus"></i>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <strong>Easy Management</strong>
                        <span>Manage employees faster</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="floating-card floating-card-two">
                    <div class="floating-icon green">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-chart-line"></i>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <strong>Smart Insights</strong>
                        <span>Track workforce data</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>
        <section class="about-intro">
            <div class="section-heading">
                <span class="section-label">WHO WE ARE</span>
                <h2>Built to make employee management <span>simple and organized.</span></h2>
            </div>
            <div class="intro-content">
                <div class="intro-text">
                    <p>EmployeeHub is an employee management solution created to simplify the everyday process of managing workforce information.</p>
                    <p>Instead of keeping employee information scattered across spreadsheets, documents and different systems, EmployeeHub brings important workforce information together in one centralized platform.</p>
                    <p>From employee profiles and departments to salary, joining dates and employment status, EmployeeHub provides a clear and organized way to manage employee records.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="intro-highlight">
                    <div class="highlight-icon">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-lightbulb"></i>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <strong>Our Goal</strong>
                        <p>Make workforce management easier, faster and more accessible for organizations of every size.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>
        <section class="about-stats">
            <div class="stat-box">
                <div class="stat-box-icon purple">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-users"></i>
                </div>
                <strong id="statEmployees">10</strong>
                <span>Employees Managed</span>
            </div>
            <div class="stat-box">
                <div class="stat-box-icon blue">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-building"></i>
                </div>
                <strong id="statDepartments">5</strong>
                <span>Departments</span>
            </div>
            <div class="stat-box">
                <div class="stat-box-icon green">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-user-check"></i>
                </div>
                <strong id="statActive">80%</strong>
                <span>Active Workforce</span>
            </div>
            <div class="stat-box">
                <div class="stat-box-icon orange">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-chart-line"></i>
                </div>
                <strong>24/7</strong>
                <span>Data Accessibility</span>
            </div>
        </section>
        <section class="features-section">
            <div class="section-heading centered">
                <span class="section-label">WHAT WE OFFER</span>
                <h2>Everything you need to manage <span>your workforce.</span></h2>
                <p>EmployeeHub provides simple tools that help keep your employee information organized and accessible.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="features-grid">
                <article class="feature-card">
                    <div class="feature-icon purple">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-users"></i>
                    </div>
                    <h3>Employee Management</h3>
                    <p>Add, view, update and manage employee profiles from a centralized workforce directory.</p>
                    <a href="/employees">
                        Manage Employees <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i>
                    </a>
                </article>
                <article class="feature-card">
                    <div class="feature-icon blue">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-chart-pie"></i>
                    </div>
                    <h3>Smart Dashboard</h3>
                    <p>Get a quick overview of employee counts, departments, workforce status and payroll.</p>
                    <a href="/dashboard">
                        Open Dashboard<i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i>
                    </a>
                </article>
                <article class="feature-card">
                    <div class="feature-icon green">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-filter"></i>
                    </div>
                    <h3>Powerful Search & Filters</h3>
                    <p>Quickly find employees using search, department, status, salary and sorting options.</p>
                    <a href="/employees">
                        Browse Directory <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i>
                    </a>
                </article>
                <article class="feature-card">
                    <div class="feature-icon orange">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-indian-rupee-sign"></i>
                    </div>
                    <h3>Payroll Overview</h3>
                    <p>Keep track of monthly workforce payroll and understand salary distribution at a glance.</p>
                </article>
                <article class="feature-card">
                    <div class="feature-icon cyan">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-building"></i>
                    </div>
                    <h3>Department Organization</h3>
                    <p>Organize employees by departments and understand how your workforce is distributed.</p>
                </article>
                <article class="feature-card">
                    <div class="feature-icon pink">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-mobile-screen"></i>
                    </div>
                    <h3>Responsive Experience</h3>
                    <p>Access important workforce information through a clean interface designed for different screen sizes.</p>
                </article>
            </div>
        </section>
        <section class="how-section">
            <div class="section-heading">
                <span class="section-label">HOW IT WORKS</span>
                <h2>Manage your workforce <span>in three simple steps.</span></h2>
            </div>
            <div class="steps-grid">
                <div class="step-card">
                    <div class="step-number">01</div>
                    <div class="step-icon">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-user-plus"></i>
                    </div>
                    <h3>Add Employees</h3>
                    <p>Create employee profiles with their personal, professional and employment information.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="step-card">
                    <div class="step-number">02</div>
                    <div class="step-icon">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-layer-group"></i>
                    </div>
                    <h3>Organize Information</h3>
                    <p>Keep employees organized by department, position, salary and employment status.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="step-card">
                    <div class="step-number">03</div>
                    <div class="step-icon">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-chart-line"></i>
                    </div>
                    <h3>Track & Manage</h3>
                    <p>Use the dashboard and employee directory to monitor your workforce and make better decisions.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>
        <section class="benefits-section">
            <div class="benefits-visual">
                <div class="benefits-card">
                    <div class="benefits-card-top">
                        <div>
                            <span>EMPLOYEEHUB</span>
                            <h3>One place for your workforce</h3>
                        </div>
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-shield-halved"></i>
                    </div>
                    <div class="benefit-line">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-check"></i>
                        <span>Centralized employee information</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="benefit-line">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-check"></i>
                        <span>Easy employee search</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="benefit-line">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-check"></i>
                        <span>Department organization</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="benefit-line">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-check"></i>
                        <span>Workforce statistics</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="benefit-line">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-check"></i>
                        <span>Payroll overview</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="benefits-content">
                <span class="section-label">WHY EMPLOYEEHUB</span>
                <h2>Less complexity. <span>More control.</span></h2>
                <p>EmployeeHub is designed around one simple idea: employee management should not feel complicated.</p>
                <div class="benefit-list">
                    <div class="benefit-item">
                        <div class="benefit-check">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-check"></i>
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <strong>Centralized Information</strong>
                            <span>Keep important employee details in one organized place.</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="benefit-item">
                        <div class="benefit-check">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-check"></i>
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <strong>Faster Workflows</strong>
                            <span>Reduce repetitive work and quickly find the information you need.</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="benefit-item">
                        <div class="benefit-check">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-check"></i>
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <strong>Clear Workforce Insights</strong>
                            <span>Understand your workforce through simple statistics and reports.</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>
        <section class="about-cta">
            <div class="cta-icon">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-users"></i>
            </div>
            <div class="cta-content">
                <span>READY TO GET STARTED?</span>
                <h2>Start managing your workforce smarter.</h2>
                <p>Explore your employee directory and see how EmployeeHub can simplify workforce management.</p>
            </div>
            <a href="/employees" class="cta-btn">
                Get Started <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i>
            </a>
        </section>
    </main>
    <%- include("partials/footer") %>
    <script src="/js/navbar.js"></script>
    <script src="/js/about.js"></script>
</body>
</html>